ring, but then he blushes and smiles. It does not matter to him which finger the ring is on, he is happy and so is James~\n\nWhat the ring looks like: \n\nhttps://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0219/6494/7528/products/flower-jasmine-side-1_2000x2000.jpg?v=1557357248\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EbtKBX0IhKcYxZgge-dWrC1XgiPoGvE7", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rei_eichi_/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d164a7f/uploads/origins/fc09cbf9-2da5-427f-8ae6-8eeee5ead1fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e34ff236e4254c1d38aec094ae593af7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d164a7f/uploads/origins/fc09cbf9-2da5-427f-8ae6-8eeee5ead1fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e34ff236e4254c1d38aec094ae593af7, https://si.imgix.net/6d164a7f/uploads/origins/fc09cbf9-2da5-427f-8ae6-8eeee5ead1fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=169dc1738861bc1b2d9f8a200ed12356 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d164a7f/uploads/origins/fc09cbf9-2da5-427f-8ae6-8eeee5ead1fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2cfe08c4be3312abbbd68124f3a1b158 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1789560, "client_id": 1761072, "nc": 145}, {"path": "/@rei_eichi_/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1789560, "client_id": 702918, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"